{"id":"eeefa02192bbb359","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-split-higher-order-fibration.md","title":"分裂的高阶逻辑结构","display":"df-split-higher-order-fibration — 分裂的高阶逻辑结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-split-higher-order-fibration","display":"df-split-higher-order-fibration — 分裂的高阶逻辑结构","depends_on":["[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]","[[16-df-split-fibration]]","[[16-df-cleavage]]","[[16-df-split-generic]]","[[16-df-simple-quantification]]","[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]","[[16-df-eq-functor]]","[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]","[[16-df-set]]"],"source":"Definition 5.3.1, split convention and Examples 5.3.2–5.3.4, pp. 330–334 (PDF 350–354)","revision_date":"2026-10-20","aliases":["16-df-split-higher-order-fibration"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-split-higher-order-fibration"},{"key":"display","html":"df-split-higher-order-fibration — 分裂的高阶逻辑结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ae5978eb27da451\" href=\"?note=6ae5978eb27da451\" title=\"16-df-higher-order-fibration\">16-df-higher-order-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2508bee9cd5dcead\" href=\"?note=2508bee9cd5dcead\" title=\"16-df-split-generic\">16-df-split-generic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e39d17458a2b0aa4\" href=\"?note=e39d17458a2b0aa4\" title=\"16-df-simple-quantification\">16-df-simple-quantification</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d70ce677a3070a45\" href=\"?note=d70ce677a3070a45\" title=\"16-df-eq-functor\">16-df-eq-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 5.3.1, split convention and Examples 5.3.2–5.3.4, pp. 330–334 (PDF 350–354)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-split-higher-order-fibration</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为纤维化，基底固定有限积。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a> 的候选箭头族：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to pY\">\\(u:I\\to pY\\)</span>，指定一条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa(u,Y)\">\\(\\kappa(u,Y)\\)</span>，尚未假设它是所需的提升；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span> 成立时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^{*\\kappa}\">\\(u^{*\\kappa}\\)</span> 表示该选择构造的重索引函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{p,\\kappa}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{p,\\kappa}(G)\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"2508bee9cd5dcead\" href=\"?note=2508bee9cd5dcead\" title=\"16-df-split-generic\">16-df-split-generic</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_I=\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\">\\(O_I=\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_I,\\simeq_I\">\\(\\leq_I,\\simeq_I\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a> 的箭头存在关系及双向可达关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I\">\\(\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I\\)</span> 为第一投影，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{I,J}=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_{I\\times J},\\pi_2^{I,J}\\rangle\">\\(\\delta_{I,J}=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_{I\\times J},\\pi_2^{I,J}\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J,K\">\\(I,J,K\\)</span> 遍历基底对象。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell=(t,b,m,v,r,\\Sigma,\\Pi,E)\">\\(\\ell=(t,b,m,v,r,\\Sigma,\\Pi,E)\\)</span> 是候选对象数据记录；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,b,m,v,r\">\\(t,b,m,v,r\\)</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span> 索引的集合族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\Pi,E\">\\(\\Sigma,\\Pi,E\\)</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)^2\">\\((\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)^2\\)</span> 索引的集合族，因此每个分量都已有值。其值满足所需对象/函数类型的条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TypedLogicData}_p\">\\(\\mathrm{TypedLogicData}_p\\)</span> 检验。它们分别表示顶、底、二元积、二元余积、蕴涵、简单存在量词、简单全称量词、带参数等式。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibPre}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{FibPre}(p)\\)</span> 成立的分支中，指定对象函数的箭头作用只能是相应 Hom 中的唯一箭头；下面直接用序关系表达其泛性质。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicBase}_{p,\\kappa}\">\\(\\mathrm{LogicBase}_{p,\\kappa}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicData}_{p,\\kappa}\">\\(\\mathrm{LogicData}_{p,\\kappa}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictLogic}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictLogic}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitHOFibData}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitHOFibData}\\)</span> 及它们的存在性包装在下文定义。所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^{*\\kappa}\">\\(u^{*\\kappa}\\)</span> 均由同一参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 决定，所有运算均为同一记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 的分量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFib}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BC}\">\\(\\mathrm{BC}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a>。最后一式的论域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span>；一般 BC 的可逆性不依赖提升选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TypedLogicData}_p(\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall I)\\bigl[t_I,b_I\\in O_I\\land m_I,v_I,r_I:O_I^2\\to O_I\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J)\\bigl[\\Sigma_{I,J},\\Pi_{I,J}:O_{I\\times J}\\to O_I\n\\land E_{I,J}:O_{I\\times J}\\to O_{(I\\times J)\\times J}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TypedLogicData}_p(\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall I)\\bigl[t_I,b_I\\in O_I\\land m_I,v_I,r_I:O_I^2\\to O_I\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J)\\bigl[\\Sigma_{I,J},\\Pi_{I,J}:O_{I\\times J}\\to O_I\n\\land E_{I,J}:O_{I\\times J}\\to O_{(I\\times J)\\times J}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicBase}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{FibPre}(p)\\land\\mathrm{TypedLogicData}_p(\\ell).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LogicBase}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{FibPre}(p)\\land\\mathrm{TypedLogicData}_p(\\ell).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicData}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall I)(\\forall X\\in O_I)\\ b_I\\leq_I X\\land X\\leq_I t_I\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I)(\\forall X,Y,Z\\in O_I)\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\qquad\\bigl(Z\\leq_I m_I(X,Y)\\Longleftrightarrow Z\\leq_I X\\land Z\\leq_IY\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\bigl(v_I(X,Y)\\leq_I Z\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_I Z\\land Y\\leq_I Z\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\bigl(Z\\leq_I r_I(X,Y)\\Longleftrightarrow m_I(Z,X)\\leq_IY\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I,J)(\\forall X\\in O_{I\\times J})(\\forall Y\\in O_I)\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\qquad\\bigl(\\Sigma_{I,J}X\\leq_I Y\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_{I\\times J}\\pi_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Y\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\bigl(\\pi_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Y\\leq_{I\\times J}X\\Longleftrightarrow Y\\leq_I\\Pi_{I,J}X\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\Sigma_{I,J}\\bigl(m_{I\\times J}(\\pi_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Y,X)\\bigr)\n\\simeq_I m_I(Y,\\Sigma_{I,J}X)\\Bigr]\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I,J)(\\forall X\\in O_{I\\times J})(\\forall Z\\in O_{(I\\times J)\\times J})\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\qquad\\bigl(E_{I,J}X\\leq_{(I\\times J)\\times J}Z\n\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_{I\\times J}\\delta_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Z\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land E_{I,J}\\bigl(m_{I\\times J}(\\delta_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Z,X)\\bigr)\n\\simeq_{(I\\times J)\\times J}m_{(I\\times J)\\times J}(Z,E_{I,J}X)\\Bigr]\n\\end{gathered}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicBase}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{LogicBase}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LogicData}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall I)(\\forall X\\in O_I)\\ b_I\\leq_I X\\land X\\leq_I t_I\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I)(\\forall X,Y,Z\\in O_I)\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\qquad\\bigl(Z\\leq_I m_I(X,Y)\\Longleftrightarrow Z\\leq_I X\\land Z\\leq_IY\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\bigl(v_I(X,Y)\\leq_I Z\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_I Z\\land Y\\leq_I Z\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\bigl(Z\\leq_I r_I(X,Y)\\Longleftrightarrow m_I(Z,X)\\leq_IY\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I,J)(\\forall X\\in O_{I\\times J})(\\forall Y\\in O_I)\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\qquad\\bigl(\\Sigma_{I,J}X\\leq_I Y\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_{I\\times J}\\pi_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Y\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\bigl(\\pi_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Y\\leq_{I\\times J}X\\Longleftrightarrow Y\\leq_I\\Pi_{I,J}X\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\Sigma_{I,J}\\bigl(m_{I\\times J}(\\pi_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Y,X)\\bigr)\n\\simeq_I m_I(Y,\\Sigma_{I,J}X)\\Bigr]\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I,J)(\\forall X\\in O_{I\\times J})(\\forall Z\\in O_{(I\\times J)\\times J})\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\qquad\\bigl(E_{I,J}X\\leq_{(I\\times J)\\times J}Z\n\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_{I\\times J}\\delta_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Z\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land E_{I,J}\\bigl(m_{I\\times J}(\\delta_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Z,X)\\bigr)\n\\simeq_{(I\\times J)\\times J}m_{(I\\times J)\\times J}(Z,E_{I,J}X)\\Bigr]\n\\end{gathered}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicBase}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{LogicBase}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictLogic}(p,\\kappa,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall I,J)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))\\Bigl[\nu^{*\\kappa}t_J=t_I\\land u^{*\\kappa}b_J=b_I\\\\\n\\qquad\\land(\\forall X,Y\\in O_J)\\Bigl[\nu^{*\\kappa}m_J(X,Y)=m_I(u^{*\\kappa}X,u^{*\\kappa}Y)\\\\\n\\qquad\\qquad\\land u^{*\\kappa}v_J(X,Y)=v_I(u^{*\\kappa}X,u^{*\\kappa}Y)\\\\\n\\qquad\\qquad\\land u^{*\\kappa}r_J(X,Y)=r_I(u^{*\\kappa}X,u^{*\\kappa}Y)\\Bigr]\\Bigr]\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I,J,K)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(K,I))(\\forall X\\in O_{I\\times J})\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\qquad\\Sigma_{K,J}(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)^{*\\kappa}X\n=u^{*\\kappa}\\Sigma_{I,J}X\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\Pi_{K,J}(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)^{*\\kappa}X\n=u^{*\\kappa}\\Pi_{I,J}X\\\\\n\\qquad\\land E_{K,J}(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)^{*\\kappa}X\n=((u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)^{*\\kappa}E_{I,J}X\\Bigr]\n\\end{gathered}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicData}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{LogicData}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{StrictLogic}(p,\\kappa,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall I,J)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))\\Bigl[\nu^{*\\kappa}t_J=t_I\\land u^{*\\kappa}b_J=b_I\\\\\n\\qquad\\land(\\forall X,Y\\in O_J)\\Bigl[\nu^{*\\kappa}m_J(X,Y)=m_I(u^{*\\kappa}X,u^{*\\kappa}Y)\\\\\n\\qquad\\qquad\\land u^{*\\kappa}v_J(X,Y)=v_I(u^{*\\kappa}X,u^{*\\kappa}Y)\\\\\n\\qquad\\qquad\\land u^{*\\kappa}r_J(X,Y)=r_I(u^{*\\kappa}X,u^{*\\kappa}Y)\\Bigr]\\Bigr]\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I,J,K)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(K,I))(\\forall X\\in O_{I\\times J})\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\qquad\\Sigma_{K,J}(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)^{*\\kappa}X\n=u^{*\\kappa}\\Sigma_{I,J}X\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\Pi_{K,J}(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)^{*\\kappa}X\n=u^{*\\kappa}\\Pi_{I,J}X\\\\\n\\qquad\\land E_{K,J}(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)^{*\\kappa}X\n=((u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)^{*\\kappa}E_{I,J}X\\Bigr]\n\\end{gathered}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicData}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{LogicData}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictLogic}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists\\kappa,\\ell)\\bigl[\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{StrictLogic}(p,\\kappa,\\ell)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{StrictLogic}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists\\kappa,\\ell)\\bigl[\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{StrictLogic}(p,\\kappa,\\ell)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SplitHOBase}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{StrictLogic}(p,\\kappa,\\ell)\\land G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E,\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitHOFibData}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{p,\\kappa}(G)&amp;\\mathrm{SplitHOBase}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{SplitHOBase}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitHOFib}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists\\kappa,\\ell,G)\\ \\mathrm{SplitHOFibData}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitHOFib}(p)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{FOFib}(p),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{SplitHOFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{BC}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SplitHOBase}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{StrictLogic}(p,\\kappa,\\ell)\\land G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E,\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitHOFibData}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{p,\\kappa}(G)&amp;\\mathrm{SplitHOBase}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G),\\\\\n\\bot&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{SplitHOBase}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitHOFib}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists\\kappa,\\ell,G)\\ \\mathrm{SplitHOFibData}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitHOFib}(p)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{FOFib}(p),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{SplitHOFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{BC}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对象运算的泛性质、Frobenius 和严格换基均属于被量化的同一记录；不再从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFib}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFib}(p)\\)</span> 的存在断言中取未绑定的任意选择。在预序中，每个 Hom 至多一个箭头，所以单调对象运算唯一延伸为函子，序伴随给自然 Hom 双射；规范 BC 比较为恒等当且仅当其源、靶对象字面相等。因此这里的对象等式精确展开了原定义的严格 mates 条件。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{p,\\kappa}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{p,\\kappa}\\)</span> 使用严格对象分类，不要求普通泛对象的唯一同构分类。这保留实现性纤维化所需的分裂版本。一元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitHOFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitHOFib}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitTripos}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitTripos}\\)</span> 只表示相应完整结构的存在性。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.3.1 与 Examples 5.3.2–5.3.4，pp. 330–334 (PDF 350–354)。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-higher-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6ae5978eb27da451","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cleavage]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-generic","status":"resolved","id":"2508bee9cd5dcead","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-generic]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"e39d17458a2b0aa4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-simple-quantification]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-first-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-functor","status":"resolved","id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化，基底固定有限积。$\\kappa$ 是 [[16-df-cleavage]] 的候选箭头族：对每个 $Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$ 与 $u:I\\to pY$，指定一条 $\\mathcal E$ 箭头 $\\kappa(u,Y)$，尚未假设它是所需的提升；在 $\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$ 成立时，$u^{*\\kappa}$ 表示该选择构造的重索引函子。$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$、$\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{p,\\kappa}(G)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-split-fibration]]、[[16-df-split-generic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化，基底固定有限积。$\\kappa$ 是 [[16-df-cleavage]] 的候选箭头族：对每个 $Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$ 与 $u:I\\to pY$，指定一条 $\\mathcal E$ 箭头 $\\kappa(u,Y)$，尚未假设它是所需的提升；在 $\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$ 成立时，$u^{*\\kappa}$ 表示该选择构造的重索引函子。$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$、$\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{p,\\kappa}(G)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-split-fibration]]、[[16-df-split-generic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-generic","status":"resolved","id":"2508bee9cd5dcead","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化，基底固定有限积。$\\kappa$ 是 [[16-df-cleavage]] 的候选箭头族：对每个 $Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$ 与 $u:I\\to pY$，指定一条 $\\mathcal E$ 箭头 $\\kappa(u,Y)$，尚未假设它是所需的提升；在 $\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$ 成立时，$u^{*\\kappa}$ 表示该选择构造的重索引函子。$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$、$\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{p,\\kappa}(G)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-split-fibration]]、[[16-df-split-generic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$O_I=\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I$；$\\leq_I,\\simeq_I$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]] 的箭头存在关系及双向可达关系。$\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I$ 为第一投影，$\\delta_{I,J}=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_{I\\times J},\\pi_2^{I,J}\\rangle$。$I,J,K$ 遍历基底对象。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CCC}$、$\\mathrm{FOFib}$、$\\mathrm{BC}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]。最后一式的论域为 $p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$；一般 BC 的可逆性不依赖提升选择。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-first-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-17","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CCC}$、$\\mathrm{FOFib}$、$\\mathrm{BC}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]。最后一式的论域为 $p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$；一般 BC 的可逆性不依赖提升选择。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-18","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CCC}$、$\\mathrm{FOFib}$、$\\mathrm{BC}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]。最后一式的论域为 $p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$；一般 BC 的可逆性不依赖提升选择。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to pY","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa(u,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"u^{*\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{p,\\kappa}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"O_I=\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_I,\\simeq_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_{I,J}=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_{I\\times J},\\pi_2^{I,J}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"I,J,K","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell=(t,b,m,v,r,\\Sigma,\\Pi,E)","display":false},{"tex":"t,b,m,v,r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma,\\Pi,E","display":false},{"tex":"(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TypedLogicData}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibPre}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogicBase}_{p,\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogicData}_{p,\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrictLogic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitHOFibData}","display":false},{"tex":"u^{*\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BC}","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TypedLogicData}_p(\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\forall I)\\bigl[t_I,b_I\\in O_I\\land m_I,v_I,r_I:O_I^2\\to O_I\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I,J)\\bigl[\\Sigma_{I,J},\\Pi_{I,J}:O_{I\\times J}\\to O_I\n\\land E_{I,J}:O_{I\\times J}\\to O_{(I\\times J)\\times J}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogicBase}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{FibPre}(p)\\land\\mathrm{TypedLogicData}_p(\\ell).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogicData}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall I)(\\forall X\\in O_I)\\ b_I\\leq_I X\\land X\\leq_I t_I\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I)(\\forall X,Y,Z\\in O_I)\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\qquad\\bigl(Z\\leq_I m_I(X,Y)\\Longleftrightarrow Z\\leq_I X\\land Z\\leq_IY\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\bigl(v_I(X,Y)\\leq_I Z\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_I Z\\land Y\\leq_I Z\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\bigl(Z\\leq_I r_I(X,Y)\\Longleftrightarrow m_I(Z,X)\\leq_IY\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I,J)(\\forall X\\in O_{I\\times J})(\\forall Y\\in O_I)\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\qquad\\bigl(\\Sigma_{I,J}X\\leq_I Y\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_{I\\times J}\\pi_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Y\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\bigl(\\pi_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Y\\leq_{I\\times J}X\\Longleftrightarrow Y\\leq_I\\Pi_{I,J}X\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\Sigma_{I,J}\\bigl(m_{I\\times J}(\\pi_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Y,X)\\bigr)\n\\simeq_I m_I(Y,\\Sigma_{I,J}X)\\Bigr]\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I,J)(\\forall X\\in O_{I\\times J})(\\forall Z\\in O_{(I\\times J)\\times J})\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\qquad\\bigl(E_{I,J}X\\leq_{(I\\times J)\\times J}Z\n\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_{I\\times J}\\delta_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Z\\bigr)\\\\\n\\qquad\\land E_{I,J}\\bigl(m_{I\\times J}(\\delta_{I,J}^{*\\kappa}Z,X)\\bigr)\n\\simeq_{(I\\times J)\\times J}m_{(I\\times J)\\times J}(Z,E_{I,J}X)\\Bigr]\n\\end{gathered}&\\mathrm{LogicBase}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell),\\\\\n\\bot&\\neg\\mathrm{LogicBase}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrictLogic}(p,\\kappa,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall I,J)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))\\Bigl[\nu^{*\\kappa}t_J=t_I\\land u^{*\\kappa}b_J=b_I\\\\\n\\qquad\\land(\\forall X,Y\\in O_J)\\Bigl[\nu^{*\\kappa}m_J(X,Y)=m_I(u^{*\\kappa}X,u^{*\\kappa}Y)\\\\\n\\qquad\\qquad\\land u^{*\\kappa}v_J(X,Y)=v_I(u^{*\\kappa}X,u^{*\\kappa}Y)\\\\\n\\qquad\\qquad\\land u^{*\\kappa}r_J(X,Y)=r_I(u^{*\\kappa}X,u^{*\\kappa}Y)\\Bigr]\\Bigr]\\\\\n\\land(\\forall I,J,K)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(K,I))(\\forall X\\in O_{I\\times J})\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\qquad\\Sigma_{K,J}(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)^{*\\kappa}X\n=u^{*\\kappa}\\Sigma_{I,J}X\\\\\n\\qquad\\land\\Pi_{K,J}(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)^{*\\kappa}X\n=u^{*\\kappa}\\Pi_{I,J}X\\\\\n\\qquad\\land E_{K,J}(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)^{*\\kappa}X\n=((u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)\\times\\operatorname{id}_J)^{*\\kappa}E_{I,J}X\\Bigr]\n\\end{gathered}&\\mathrm{LogicData}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell),\\\\\n\\bot&\\neg\\mathrm{LogicData}_{p,\\kappa}(\\ell).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrictLogic}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists\\kappa,\\ell)\\bigl[\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{StrictLogic}(p,\\kappa,\\ell)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SplitHOBase}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{StrictLogic}(p,\\kappa,\\ell)\\land G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E,\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitHOFibData}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{p,\\kappa}(G)&\\mathrm{SplitHOBase}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G),\\\\\n\\bot&\\neg\\mathrm{SplitHOBase}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitHOFib}(p)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists\\kappa,\\ell,G)\\ \\mathrm{SplitHOFibData}(p,\\kappa,\\ell,G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitHOFib}(p)&\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{FOFib}(p),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{SplitHOFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{BC}(p).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFib}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{p,\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitHOFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitTripos}","display":false}],"bytes":7101,"backlinks":[{"id":"f36bc28426b1a7dc","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\wedge_L\\psi,\\varphi\\vee_L\\psi,\\varphi\\Rightarrow_L\\psi$ 为本页定义的逐点谓词；$\\varphi,\\psi:L\\to\\mathcal P(A)$。$\\mathrm{FOFib}$、$\\mathrm{BC}$、$\\mathrm{SplitTripos}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]。分裂取 $\\kappa_A$，泛对象取 $G_A$；量词的对象作用采用下式，箭头作用取相应预序 Hom 中的唯一箭头。"},{"id":"3e07004160abc932","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\lor\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)$，分别采用 [[16-df-tripos]] 与 [[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]。两种结构均蕴含 $\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)$；$\\mathbf{Set}(p)$ 使用 [[16-df-set-of-fibration]] 的同一完整关系商范畴构造。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-343","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration|df-split-higher-order-fibration — 分裂的高阶逻辑结构]]"},{"id":"55e5037ed821c800","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tripos}$、$\\mathrm{SplitTripos}$、$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-tripos]]、[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]。"}],"outgoing":["6ae5978eb27da451","eb3d8d8bfc151af6","4ea27d39c2af987b","2508bee9cd5dcead","e39d17458a2b0aa4","86e53aa076639692","18a4c8ba03fadf06","66d3058a6ae62dc5","d70ce677a3070a45","ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","09b2ae01fb2d54e3"]}